# JavaFX CSS reference checker

## Trigger
Use when user asks to verify JavaFX CSS rules with official doc.

## Official doc
- https://openjfx.io/javadoc/26/javafx.graphics/javafx/scene/doc-files/cssref.html

## Quick checklist
- selector exists
- property exists
- value format matches JavaFX CSS syntax
- property applies to the targeted control

## Response format
- Valid
- Invalid or uncertain
- Fixes
